kcsdi-rs

Protocol work is informed by the KC901 programming manual, B002-008,
third edition, KeXinShe, August 2023, https://www.measall.com/.
It is cross-checked against device behavior documented by KCSDI from
MEASALL Technology, https://deepace.net/products/software/kcsdi-software/.
The interface layout also references KCSDI.

The GUI includes Droid Sans Fallback 2.55b under Apache-2.0.
Its font metadata credits Google Corporation, 2006, and Ascender Corporation.
The accompanying notice credits the Android Open Source Project, 2005-2008.
The full text accompanies the font as DroidSansFallback-Apache2.0.txt.
Android font sources: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-4.0.4_r2.1/data/fonts/

The CI and release workflows adapt the native build and package process from
die-yield-calculator, https://github.com/vowstar/die-yield-calculator.

Thanks to these projects for their documentation, fonts and build tools.
